## Appendix

### Command Reference

**Essential CP/M Commands**:
```
DIR                 List files on current drive
STAT B:             Show disk status for drive B:
PIP A:*.COM B:      Copy all .COM files from A: to B:
A>                  Prompt shows current drive (A:)
D>                  Switch to drive D:
PLAY                Start game on current disk
SAVE name.ext       Save current state to file
RESTORE name.ext    Restore saved state from file
```

**Control Sequences**:
- `^C`: Warm start (reset)
- `^S`: Pause execution
- `^P`: Printer echo
- `^X`: Cancel line entry
- `Tab`: Switch terminal type

