### Command Cheat Sheet

**File Management**:
```
LOAD TAPE          Load file from paper tape reader
SAVE TAPE          Save punched tape to file
PIP FILE.TXT=RDR:  Read tape file into machine
PIP PUN:=FILE.TXT  Punch file to tape
```

**Debugging**:
```
DEBUG             Open debugger tab
^K                Step instruction
^J                Step over (call/rst)
Pause             Stop CPU execution
Continue          Resume execution
```

**Printer Commands**:
```
PRTDEMO           Demonstrate printer capabilities
PNG               Save current page as PNG
PRINT             Print or save as PDF
FF                Form feed
TEAR OFF           Start new sheet
```

